    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "The route changes · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to choose a route after a disruption and explain how to reach the destination.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-10-required-interaction-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Respond to the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-10-required-interaction-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "The route changes · 1: A partner proposes acting immediately on the first part of this account. Explain the later information they need, ask one clarification, and negotiate a suitable next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "我去外地看朋友。他说下午两点在学校见，学校在朋友家北边。我想走路去，可以看看这里，也可以运动。\n\n吃完午饭，我把朋友说的地点写在本子上，拿着本子出门。到了路口，我不知道哪边是北。我问路边的一个人，他告诉我先过马路，再往北走。\n\n我没有马上过马路，先看本子上写的学校。它在朋友家北边，不在南边。我再问那个人学校在哪里，他说学校在银行和医院中间。\n\n我过了马路，往北走了十分钟，看见银行，也看见旁边的学校。到学校的时候，还没有两点，朋友在门口等我，我没有晚到。\n\n朋友问我怎么来的。我说没有坐车，是看着本子走来的。回朋友家的时候，我知道要往南走。回去和来的时候走的路一样，但是要往南走，不能往北走。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My reply uses the later information instead of simply repeating the first claim."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "My clarification and proposed next step address the practical constraint."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
